abstract: >
  Bidirectional coupling of LISFLOOD-FP (8.1.0 / commit 637106b) surface flood
  modelling with EPA SWMM 5.1.015 sewer modelling, including COUPLED outfalls
  and manhole weir/orifice exchange.
keywords:
